      "text": "family of Lehi1 travel in wilderness, 1 Ne. 2:5 (7:21; 16:15; 17:1). group of Limhi’s people traveled in land of many waters, Mosiah 8:7–8. sons of Mosiah2 traveled throughout Zarahemla striving to repair injuries, Mosiah 27:35. Alma2 traveled to Ammonihah, Alma 8:6. missionaries traveled from house to house, relying upon mercies of world, Alma 26:28. Alma2 has labored for own support, notwithstanding many travels, Alma 30:32.",
